    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\ncompletion\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nI have been really enjoying using mini.completion, and have enjoyed that it is only sourcing suggestions from text previously written.\r\n\r\nApologies if this is already possible with the config. \r\n\r\nA nice improvement would be to auto use the first suggestion after pressing tab. ",
